"Richard Thorn was Alden Thorn's father and a pastor."
"His old church was in Nashville, before the family moved to Chicago."
"Alden looks like him: green eyes, hair between brown and auburn, average height."
"He and his wife Leah died in the Body Drainer attack on their new Chicago apartment."
"Their bedroom was buried under debris fallen from above and from the roof."
"Officially they died when Arjun Thomas broke through the wall."
"Alden believes they died earlier, in the first explosions."
"Some websites list them as collateral damage."
"A children's choir director from his old church drove overnight from Nashville to visit Alden."
"Alden placed a daisy on his casket."
